            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.7.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atolapay kïkut malaykayanteto mut nko odeny kontinyi, kuteghyeghö kutïwa yïm cho kilentöy, “Mi ye nyu paytaghpa ngwïny mori Echotyontencha nko Masiyenyi, akïpöytoy kokay nko kokay!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïköpïghchï kegh ngwïny kïrïwotö mutïnekwa akïsagh Tororöt poyichay le 24, cho kitïpïyot ngöcherwekwa cho pö paytagh ompö tawu Tororöt ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
